From: HDSatelit <dev@hdsatelit.local>
Subject: [PATCH] JSC: include the compilation result before its enumerators

The baseline-only JIT build otherwise sees only the forward declaration
of CompilationResult in setupJIT. Include its complete definition directly.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
diff --git a/Source/JavaScriptCore/runtime/ScriptExecutable.cpp b/Source/JavaScriptCore/runtime/ScriptExecutable.cpp
--- a/Source/JavaScriptCore/runtime/ScriptExecutable.cpp
+++ b/Source/JavaScriptCore/runtime/ScriptExecutable.cpp
@@ -26,6 +26,7 @@
 #include "config.h"
 
 #include "CodeBlock.h"
+#include "CompilationResult.h"
 #include "Debugger.h"
 #include "EvalCodeBlock.h"
 #include "FunctionCodeBlock.h"
